  "goodToKnow": "Die Diözese is a diocese, the area led by a bishop; the German synonym is das Bistum. Germany has 27 Catholic (arch)dioceses, which collect church tax through the state tax offices. The adjective diözesan appears in Diözesanrat or Diözesanmuseum. From Greek dioikesis (administration). Pronounced di-ö-TSAY-ze. Plural: die Diözesen."
